%H A077055 Stéphane Legendre, <a href="https://ajc.maths.uq.edu.au/pdf/58/ajc_v58_p275.pdf">Foldings and meanders</a>, Australasian Journal of Combinatorics 58(2) (2014), 275-291. See Proposition 6.1 and Table 3.
